{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "良久云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "良久云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "良久，云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "咄！"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "蜀僧存公，生緣受業，及得法之師，始終詳悉。後人未之知，此但據普菴所錄云\n耳。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師乾道四年佛生之月，書于東井，以益參徒之知而不昧也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "并序"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "良久，云："}
